.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class USER> double \fBcsmp::H2O_CO2_NaCl_FlowFunctions\fP< dim, USER >::dfds (\fBElement\fP< dim > * const e, uint32_t phase, uint32_t n) const"

.PP
derivative of fractional flow w\&.r\&.t water saturation (used in advection multiplier); note that fw+fn=1, dfw_dsw=dfn_dsn Derivative of fractional flow function w\&.r\&.t water saturation; note that fw+fn=1, dfw_dsw = -dfn_dsn\&.

